==Special Moves==
====Avoid Mine====
{{FrameDataCargo-COTW
|moveId=kevin_214K,kevin_214BD
|input=214B/D/BD
|input2=qcb+B/D/BD
|description2= Kevin performs a quick combat roll toward the opponent. Invulnerable to projectiles.
----
'''Normal version (214B/D)''': Primarily used to move through projectiles.
