* Plus on block if braked, and the first hit pulls the opponent closer on block
* Launches on hit if braked. If not braked, the second hit can be canceled into uncharged 214AC
* In addition to heavies, Close A and 2A can also combo into this if they hit as a counterhit / Wild Punish
